  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.630" end="00:10.610" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I hate you, bigchase)</p>
      <p begin="00:10.610" end="00:12.710" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:12.710" end="00:16.070" ttm:agent="v1">Like what you want? I got what you need</p>
      <p begin="00:16.070" end="00:19.390" ttm:agent="v1">I felt it in my veins, sun came up and I can't sleep</p>
      <p begin="00:19.390" end="00:22.790" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I back to back the blunt, I can't ever leave</p>
      <p begin="00:22.790" end="00:26.290" ttm:agent="v1">If I wasn't up on that stage, I'd take my life and count up sheep</p>
      <p begin="00:26.290" end="00:29.720" ttm:agent="v1">What you, what- what you want? I got what you need</p>
      <p begin="00:29.720" end="00:32.840" ttm:agent="v1">I felt it in my veins, sun came up and I can't sleep</p>
      <p begin="00:32.840" end="00:36.180" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I back to back the blunt, I can't ever leave</p>
      <p begin="00:36.180" end="00:39.950" ttm:agent="v1">If I wasn't up on that stage, I'd take my life and count up sheep</p>
      <p begin="00:39.950" end="00:41.450" ttm:agent="v1">What you, what- what you want?</p>
      <p begin="00:41.440" end="00:44.500" ttm:agent="v1">I know it's not the same, said, &quot;Girl, its been too long&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:44.500" end="00:48.090" ttm:agent="v1">The drugs, it take too long to hit, I know it's wrong</p>
      <p begin="00:48.090" end="00:51.320" ttm:agent="v1">I smoke to heal the pain, I try to ease the fog</p>
      <p begin="00:51.320" end="00:54.780" ttm:agent="v1">In the abyss I mourn, I wish you didn't call</p>
      <p begin="00:54.780" end="00:57.150" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, numb, drugs, take some</p>
      <p begin="00:57.150" end="01:01.120" ttm:agent="v1">Fillin' up my nose with that dangerous</p>
      <p begin="01:01.120" end="01:04.410" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me cold, stuck n' sending, shots n' slugs</p>
      <p begin="01:04.410" end="01:08.820" ttm:agent="v1">If I die today then bury me with my chains on, then let it go</p>
      <p begin="01:08.820" end="01:11.990" ttm:agent="v1">Hard to change when broken down, but I done changed the bank</p>
      <p begin="01:11.990" end="01:15.270" ttm:agent="v1">I turned that penny to a mill' within a night and day</p>
      <p begin="01:15.270" end="01:18.350" ttm:agent="v1">I cut off bitches that ain't wit' me with a knife and blade</p>
      <p begin="01:18.350" end="01:21.840" ttm:agent="v1">It's easy to say, the only ones close to me ain't never asked me for change</p>
      <p begin="01:21.840" end="01:24.110" ttm:agent="v1">Like what you want? I got what you need</p>
      <p begin="01:24.110" end="01:27.450" ttm:agent="v1">I felt it in my veins, sun came up and I can't sleep</p>
      <p begin="01:27.450" end="01:30.800" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I back to back the blunt, I can't ever leave</p>
      <p begin="01:30.800" end="01:34.180" ttm:agent="v1">If I wasn't up on that stage, I'd take my life and count up sheep</p>
      <p begin="01:34.180" end="01:37.960" ttm:agent="v1">What you, what- what you want? I got what you need</p>
      <p begin="01:37.960" end="01:41.080" ttm:agent="v1">I felt it in my veins, sun came up and I can't sleep</p>
      <p begin="01:41.080" end="01:44.540" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I back to back the blunt, I can't ever leave</p>
      <p begin="01:44.540" end="01:47.680" ttm:agent="v1">If I wasn't up on that stage, I'd take my life and count up sheep</p>
      <p begin="01:47.680" end="01:51.550" ttm:agent="v1">What you, what- what you want?</p>
      <p begin="01:51.550" end="01:55.120" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:55.120" end="01:58.260" ttm:agent="v1">Like what you want?</p>
      <p begin="01:58.260" end="02:02.050" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:02.050" end="02:03.550" ttm:agent="v1">What- what you want?</p>
